WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.561
Let’s add one pupil to the class register. Read her card, then fill in one row.

00:00:06.561 --> 00:00:12.927
Start with the name on the card. Click the empty box under Name and type the same name.

00:00:12.927 --> 00:00:18.060
Look for Age. She is eight, so type eight under Age.

00:00:18.060 --> 00:00:24.914
Now find when she was born. Copy the day, the month, and the year into Date of birth.

00:00:24.914 --> 00:00:30.862
Copy the family phone number. Start with zero, and check every digit.

00:00:30.862 --> 00:00:37.864
Read across the row. Then click Check my work. Now try it with the pupil on your own card.
